<section id="home-view" hidden aria-labelledby="home-title">
 <div class="section-heading"><div><h1 id="home-title">Hoy en tu negocio</h1><p id="home-date"></p></div><button id="home-refresh" class="secondary" data-icon="rotate" type="button">Actualizar resumen</button></div>
 <p id="home-message" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
 <div id="home-content" hidden>
  <p id="home-updated" class="hint"></p>
  <div class="home-layout">
   <div class="home-main">
    <section class="home-section" aria-labelledby="home-day-title"><div class="home-section-heading"><h2 id="home-day-title">Ventas del día</h2><button class="edit-button" data-home-nav="nav-reports" type="button">Ver reporte</button></div><dl class="home-ledger"><div><dt>Ventas registradas <small id="home-tickets"></small></dt><dd id="home-gross"></dd></div><div><dt>Devoluciones y cancelaciones <small id="home-refund-count"></small></dt><dd id="home-refunds"></dd></div><div class="home-net"><dt>Ventas netas</dt><dd id="home-net"></dd></div></dl><p class="hint">Importes con impuestos. Incluye ventas a crédito; los abonos no se cuentan como nuevas ventas. Las devoluciones corresponden al día en que se registraron.</p><div class="home-expense"><div><strong>Gastos del día</strong><p id="home-expense-count" class="hint"></p></div><strong id="home-expenses"></strong><button class="edit-button" data-home-nav="nav-expenses" type="button">Ver gastos</button></div><p class="hint">Los gastos se muestran por su fecha de gasto y separados de las ventas. No incluyen compras ni pagos a proveedores.</p></section>
    <section class="home-section" aria-labelledby="home-cash-title"><div class="home-section-heading"><h2 id="home-cash-title">Cajas abiertas <span id="home-cash-count" class="home-count"></span></h2><button class="edit-button" data-home-nav="nav-cash" type="button">Ver cajas</button></div><div class="table-scroll" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Cajas abiertas y responsables"><table class="home-cash-table"><thead><tr><th>Caja / ubicación</th><th>Atiende</th><th>Apertura</th></tr></thead><tbody id="home-cash-rows"></tbody></table></div><p id="home-cash-help" class="hint"></p></section>
   </div>
   <section class="home-pending home-section" aria-labelledby="home-pending-title"><h2 id="home-pending-title">Cuentas pendientes</h2><p class="hint">Saldos actuales de todo el negocio.</p><div class="home-account"><h3>Por cobrar a clientes</h3><strong id="home-receivables" class="home-account-total"></strong><p id="home-credit-count" class="hint"></p><p id="home-credit-overdue"></p><button class="secondary" data-home-nav="nav-credits" type="button">Ver créditos y abonos</button></div><div class="home-account"><h3>Por pagar a proveedores</h3><strong id="home-payables" class="home-account-total"></strong><p id="home-payable-count" class="hint"></p><p id="home-payable-overdue"></p><p id="home-reconcile" class="hint"></p><button class="secondary" data-home-nav="nav-payables" type="button">Ver cuentas por pagar</button></div><p class="hint">Una cuenta se considera vencida a partir del día siguiente a su fecha de vencimiento.</p></section>
  </div>
  <section class="home-section home-inventory" aria-labelledby="home-inventory-title"><div class="home-section-heading"><div><h2 id="home-inventory-title">Inventario por reponer</h2><p id="home-inventory-count" class="hint"></p></div><button id="home-alerts" class="secondary" data-icon="boxes-stacked" type="button">Ver alertas y reposición</button></div><div class="table-scroll" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Primeras alertas de inventario"><table class="home-stock-table"><thead><tr><th>Producto / SKU</th><th>Ubicación</th><th>Existencia</th><th>Mínimo</th><th>Situación</th></tr></thead><tbody id="home-stock-rows"></tbody></table></div><p id="home-inventory-help" class="hint"></p></section>
 </div>
</section>
